  "description": "BEPLAK crystallizes in the tetragonal crystal system with space group P 42/n n m. Reported CIF formula moiety: C180 H224 O72 Pr8 S16,4(C1 H4 O1),28(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Pr1 (Pr) has 8 O neighbors; Pr2 (Pr) has 9 O neighbors; Pr1K (Pr) has 8 O neighbors; Pr2J (Pr) has 9 O neighbors; Pr1F (Pr) has 8 O neighbors; Pr2D (Pr) has 9 O neighbors; Pr1O (Pr) has 8 O neighbors; Pr2I (Pr) has 9 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 8 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 4.085-4.085 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 106.24-110.33°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C184H296O104S16Pr8. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 8 OAc (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)), 8 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
